{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learning, but with a Light Touch !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If math feels as indigestible as a litter box to you, this game might just change that! Dive into a playful and colorful world where trigonometry becomes a true <strong><u>narrative game</u></strong>, filled with humor and lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/extras/H4_fondC2.gif?t=1745394993\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Light Touch , but withlearning!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>La Liti\u00e8re Trigo</strong>, trigonometry will no longer be an abstract concept !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on explaining not only <u><strong>the essential basics</strong></u> but also <strong>the &quot;why&quot; behind the math</strong>. Through light dialogue and accessible explanations, the concepts become concrete and easy to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A training tailored to your level will be offered to you during the final phase !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is literally a <strong>private tutoring session</strong> in the form of a video game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For what levels?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>La Liti\u00e8re Trigo</strong> is designed for students who are just beginning to learn about trigonometry, like <strong>sine</strong> and <strong>cosine</strong>, and continues through to more advanced concepts like <strong>the unit circle</strong> and <strong>radians</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>United States\u00a0</strong>: generally introduced in <strong>10th or 11th grade</strong> as part of Algebra 2 or Precalculus\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>United Kingdom\u00a0</strong>: Basic trigonometry concepts are usually introduced in <strong>Year 10</strong>\u00a0and continue into <strong>Year 11</strong> with more advanced applications covered in <strong>A-Level Maths</strong> for older students.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Australia\u00a0</strong>: concepts often appear during <strong>Year 9</strong>, with more advanced concepts covered in <strong>Year 10</strong> or <strong>11</strong> as part of Precalculus or higher math courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Canada - Quebec\u00a0</strong>: is introduced in <strong>4e secondaire</strong>, with more advanced topics continuing into <strong>5e secondaire</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Canada - outside Quebec</strong> :\u00a0generally introduced as part of <strong>Algebra 2</strong> or <strong>Precalculus</strong>, often in <strong>10th or 11th grade</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/extras/h07_00.gif?t=1745394993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is suitable for students aged 13 to 17, depending on the country, but it\u2019s also useful for anyone looking <strong><u>to strengthen or review their trigonometry basics</u></strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Love Triangle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/18f3ba1c2fb21dc197f2f8e5290dc41a5d68bee2.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s Rolling!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/871c202c34a77b688b23a606fb86a272f61c6db3.jpg"},{"name":"CAH SOH TOA!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/e3791c2f1088bfc80680c76b5a4bedc4e46cda45.jpg"},{"name":"Diagnosis Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/bc13326139b7c5b49eef3d50b9d79e828c9feebf.jpg"},{"name":"Lesson Learned!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/709ecbfe047314637c8aa4847771e44012b26ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Class Clown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/09c66a8c909e6ad586aee65d47833cf025ab2680.jpg"},{"name":"Short Attention Span","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/c08bbef0f0ac83734ff9de849277da153b678cdb.jpg"},{"name":"Circle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/8d9812b88d4d93996dfc5dbd571d953f2072bdca.jpg"},{"name":"Triangle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/e3dbcf443f50a3dab600624b6a236938d8467e8e.jpg"},{"name":"Formula Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3288520/b579e65f5b4d1cc6db5dfaf878a38c50e8284047.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3288520?t=1745394993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745394993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/e20f3d4881a169a63a15eb3dd192458ddde9d367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745394993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/e20f3d4881a169a63a15eb3dd192458ddde9d367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745394993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3529790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learning, but with a Light Touch !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If math feels as indigestible as a litter box to you, this game might just change that! Dive into a playful and colorful world where trigonometry becomes a true <strong><u>narrative game</u></strong>, filled with humor and lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared