d in <strong>4e secondaire</strong>, with more advanced topics continuing into <strong>5e secondaire</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Canada - outside Quebec</strong> :\u00a0generally introduced as part of <strong>Algebra 2</strong> or <strong>Precalculus</strong>, often in <strong>10th or 11th grade</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/extras/h07_00.gif?t=1745394993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is suitable for students aged 13 to 17, depending on the country, but it\u2019s also useful for anyone looking <strong><u>to strengthen or review their trigonometry basics</u></strong>.</p>","developers":["furiouspixel_studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288520/header.jpg?t=1745394993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129648,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129648/movie480.mp4?t=1745394992","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129648/movie_max.mp4?t=1745394992"},"name":"Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129648/a717f12fb5e94643c821a932d80b70a2a1a32b5e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745394992","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129648/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745394992","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129648/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745394992"}}],"name":"The Litter: Trigo","package_groups":[